        "**Creating an Inference Pipeline for Real-time Predictions:**\n",
        "\n",
        "After training, we create a TextClassificationPipeline using the best-performing model. This pipeline provides a convenient interface for making predictions on new, unseen text inputs. It's configured to return not only the most probable 'benign' or 'harmful' label but also the full probability distribution for each class. This allows for more nuanced interpretations of the model's confidence in its classifications."
